                <invention-title lang="en">BATTERY CELL, BATTERY MODULE, AND BATTERY PACK AND VEHICLE COMPRISING SAME</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A battery cell covered by a packaging material is disclosed. The packaging material includes an aluminum layer and a polymer layer. The packaging material has a graphite layer on the aluminum layer, or on the polymer layer, or between the aluminum layer and the polymer layer. A battery module, and a battery pack, and a vehicle include the same.</p>
            </abstract>
